    <h1>Pricing that feels straightforward</h1>
    <p>Explore example monthly ranges for 24 months at 0% APR (qualified applicants). Use the toggle to switch to estimated full per‑eye totals—no surprises hidden in tiny print.</p>
    <div class="row">
      <button type="button" class="btn brand" id="openGuide">Get the 2025 price guide · PDF</button>
      <a class="btn ghost" href="/book-consultation/">Book a consult</a>
      <span class="tag">Westlake Village · Beverly Hills</span>
      <div class="toggle procedure-costs-toggle">
        <span class="meta">Show full per‑eye total</span>
